# The date prompt explains text that is not a date, and Enter then does nothing until the text is fixed, such as +3d.
file <<END
- Renew passport
END
see Renew passport
keys ms
see Start date
type blah
see Not a date from “blah”
keys <Enter>
see Start date
keys <Home> <S-End> <BS>
type +3d
keys <Enter>
hide Start date
quit
saved <<END
- Renew passport @start({today+3})
END
